<p>But hey, i enjoyed the Hector-bullying!</p>
<p>&#8230;overall, i get the feeling you missed the theme of the contest, and the whole story is hard on the verge of &quot;still an SCP anomaly&quot; &#8212; i'd rather expected this as a tale set in the Project Heimdal canon.<br />
